<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-manukyan-ocellated-lizard-ca-model-fidelity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Manukyan et al. (2017) Nature hexagonal skin-scale border thickness reduction & outer-totalistic cellular automaton — Model fidelity to source: 94/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Integrates the continuous 2D reaction-diffusion PDE on a Voronoi hexagonal skin-scale mosaic with spatially modulated border diffusivity D_border = P * D_interior (`build_hexagonal_scale_geometry` and `integrate_scale_border_pde_2d`, L215-355), demonstrating how P = 0.17 homogenizes intra-scale concentrations (discretization ratio 86.79, Ashman D = 2.85) so the PDE reduces to the hexagonal outer-totalistic CA (`simulate_hexagonal_ca`, L164-210) peaking at n_g = 3; and backs all 3 laws with machine-checked Lean 4 theorems (0 sorrys) in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_009_ocellated_lizard_ca.lean`." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-model-fidelity> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/model-fidelity" ;
    pk:hasEvidence <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-manukyan-ocellated-lizard-ca-model-fidelity-1>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-manukyan-ocellated-lizard-ca-model-fidelity-2>,
        <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/evidence/morphoeval-manukyan-ocellated-lizard-ca-model-fidelity-3> ;
    pk:hasScore 9.4e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-manukyan-ocellated-lizard-ca-morphometric-validation> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Manukyan et al. (2017) Nature hexagonal skin-scale border thickness reduction & outer-totalistic cellular automaton — Morphometric validation: 91/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "`measure_morphoeval()` (L605-680) computes 8 reference-backed quantitative morphometrics covering CA adult green-scale mean neighbor count (<n_g> = 2.38, mode = 3), black-scale mean black neighbor count (<n_b> = 3.09, mode = 3), scale-border PDE discretization ratio (86.79 at P = 0.17 vs 0.38 at P = 1.0, 228x gain), PDE scale bimodality (Ashman D = 2.85), PDE-vs-CA neighbor histogram L1 distance (0.28, CA-to-reference Pearson r = 0.966), equal-diffusion negative control suppression (std = 0.0010), and segmented *Timon lepidus* dorsal scale green fraction (0.4505 vs 0.44 ref) and mean green neighbor count (2.5976 vs 2.665 ref)." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-0.1.0-morphometric-validation> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
