    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-manukyan-ocellated-lizard-ca-overall> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
    rdfs:label "Manukyan et al. (2017) Nature hexagonal skin-scale border thickness reduction & outer-totalistic cellular automaton — MorphoEval overall 91.8/100" ;
    dct:date "2026-10-19"^^xsd:date ;
    dct:description "Pass 2 (v2) post-remediation evaluation of `2015-manukyan-ocellated-lizard-ca.py` (overall weighted score: 91.9 / 100, up +43.1 points from 48.8 / 100 in Pass 1). The remediated script integrates both the continuous 2D Kondo-Asai / Manukyan reaction-diffusion PDE on a hexagonal skin-scale geometry with inter-scale border thickness reduction factor P = h_border / h_interior = 0.17 (achieving an 86.79x inter-to-intra scale discretization ratio and bimodal Ashman D = 2.85, vs 0.38x in unattenuated continuum skin P = 1.0) and the discrete hexagonal outer-totalistic cellular automaton (peaking at n_g = 3 green and n_b = 3 black neighbors); verifies equal-diffusion (d = 1.0) and continuum-skin (P = 1.0) negative controls; segments N = 182 dorsal hexagonal scales on a SHA-256-locked Timon lepidus photograph (green fraction 0.451, Ashman D = 2.56, modal n_g = 3, mean n_g = 2.60); and backs its core identities with 3 machine-checked Lean 4 theorems in `morphoeval/lean/loops/Loop_009_ocellated_lizard_ca.lean`. Overall 91.8/100 (faithfulness 91.4, reproducibility 93.0); rubric morphoeval 0.1.0; checkpoint commit 8871db0; environment: python 3.14.7, numpy 2.4.2, scipy 1.17.0, matplotlib 3.10.8, Pillow 12.1.1. Dimension assessments: Model fidelity to source 94, Morphological realism / specimen match 90, Parameter expressivity 90, Morphometric validation 91, Source and data traceability 95, Code-to-model traceability 92, Reproducibility package 92. Output judged: docs/media/ocellated_lizard_ca_comparison.png: rendered output of 2015-manukyan-ocellated-lizard-ca.py at 8871db0, image/png, 915314 B, 2080×1300 px, artifact_sha256 c2afeff3c91e36df7e5a89fcbb8a1ec5dd0965e6d94d90713a0b0ac3b744083a (sha256 c2afeff3c91e36df7e5a89fcbb8a1ec5dd0965e6d94d90713a0b0ac3b744083a), spec_fingerprint 579c243aacdd96a2cdfa88d08e4a41c235b758e31ce77e8b010879b96d081c5f. Dual provenance: spec_fingerprint: 579c243aacdd96a2cdfa88d08e4a41c235b758e31ce77e8b010879b96d081c5f; artifact_sha256: c2afeff3c91e36df7e5a89fcbb8a1ec5dd0965e6d94d90713a0b0ac3b744083a; input_dataset_sha256: {datasets/ocellated_lizard_ca/ocellated_lizard_ca_reference.json=53832b76e25303a6..., datasets/ocellated_lizard_ca/scout_manifest.json=e5bca2d8766b49e7..., datasets/ocellated_lizard_ca/timon_lepidus_specimen.jpg=bc8e149849e6729d...}. Supersedes audit: 2026-10-19-ocellated-lizard-ca-audit." ;
    dct:subject <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/concept/morphoeval-rubric-0.1.0> ;
    pk:assessedBy <https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/model/gemini-4-argon> ;
    pk:assessmentType "morphoeval/0.1.0/overall" ;
    pk:evidenceAgainst "remediation needed: Extend the 2D hexagonal scale-border PDE to full 3D finite-element micro-CT skin-scale meshes following Fofonjka & Milinkovitch (2021)." ;
    pk:hasScore 9.18e-01 ;
    pk:hasVerdict "faithful" .

<https://w3id.org/probknow/resource/assessment/morphoeval-manukyan-ocellated-lizard-ca-parameter-expressivity> a pk:LLMClaimAssessment ;
